(Section 1: About Northwind Robotics) Tj T*
(Northwind Robotics builds warehouse robots and the fleet software that runs them.) Tj T*
(Our core hours are 10:00 to 15:00 in your local time zone.) Tj T*
(Focus Friday is the last Friday of every month.) Tj T*
