(Section 2: Equipment and Remote Work) Tj T*
(New hires receive a home office budget of 2000 US dollars.) Tj T*
(You may buy a desk, chair, monitor, or keyboard with that budget.) Tj T*
(Ask the people team before buying anything over 500 US dollars.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3: Security reminders) Tj T*
(Virtual private network sessions idle out after 8 hours.) Tj T*
(Security audit logs are kept for 400 days.) Tj T*
(This 400 day retention rule is the current company rule.) Tj T*
ET
