(Section 4: Time Off) Tj T*
(Full time employees receive 16 weeks of parental leave.) Tj T*
(You get 25 days of paid leave each year, plus public holidays.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 5: Travel) Tj T*
(Book travel at least 10 days in advance when you can.) Tj T*
(Keep every receipt and file your expense report within 30 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
